# Data display

## Scores

- Always tabular bold, bigger than team names (row: ~1.0625rem; hero: 3.25rem).
- Separator "–" in regular weight, secondary color.
- Unplayed match: time (or "vs") in secondary color — never "0 – 0".

## Standings

- Pts column: bold, largest cell in the row. Rank: tabular, quiet.
- Sport zones (promotion/relegation) = left border bar + legend; color
  confirms, the legend carries meaning (grayscale test).
- Trend arrows at the system angle (up/down/flat); flat is a dash.
- Penalties shown inline as a small neutral pill ("Pénalité −1 pt").

## Matchdays / journées

- "J3 / 5" pattern: current number huge, total small — the hero numeric of
  the cockpit.
- Round sections: typographic header (label + date + state) inside one panel,
  not one panel per round.

## Counters (À traiter)

- D9 recipe, in order: **count (1.375rem bold, semantic color) + icon + label
  + action**. Attention tone for pending, info for planning issues.

## Live

- Green pulse dot + minute ("67'"). Live always outranks other row states.
